      "rationale": "Current Zarr, NetCDF, HDF5, and GeoTIFF readers require lru 0.16. Their cache keys are integers or plain coordinate values with non-panicking drops, and none of these paths catches a key-drop panic. Upgrade when the readers accept patched lru 0.18.2 or later.",
